{
  "harness": 1,
  "name": "2708-net-ws",
  "about": "WebSocket (1.4): the mod serves WebSocket on a tcp_listen and connects to itself: 101 choosing \"chat\" of \"chat, other\" (CONNECTED data chat), text and binary echoed, a ping answered with its data, a message in two frames joined, the server's close 4000 \"bye\" (CLOSED OK 4000 with the reason, echoed); a wrong Accept and a 404 ERROR FORMAT with the HTTP status; text not UTF-8 CLOSED FORMAT 1007 (the service's close 1007); an http url, a protocol with a space, a null fn, binary 2, text not UTF-8 ARGUMENT; ws_send before CONNECTED CLOSED, send on it and ws_send after its end HANDLE",
  "proves": [
    "services.net.local",
    "services.net.ws",
    "services.registry"
  ],
  "mods": [
    "../mods/net-ws"
  ],
